; Gold spark ramp — bright cream core fading through gold to transparent
; amber. Matches the hit_spark family (cream → gold) but with a slightly
; deeper amber midtone so the pickup burst reads as a "relic-tier" event
; rather than a generic gold sparkle. Same semantic ("you gained
; something") with elevated chunkiness.
